Apple is getting ready for its big September iPhone event, which is expected to see the debut of the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-18-pro/">iPhone 18 Pro</a>, &zwnj;iPhone 18 Pro&zwnj; Max, and an all-new foldable iPhone.<br/>
